  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help children in rural South Africa see wildlife</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Africa is home to the world&apos;s most abundant wildlife, yet 99% of local people will never have the opportunity to witness it. #kevinandthekids is a campaign to help the big dreams of small become real, as children from impoverished backgrounds get the opportunity to go on safari! The project aims to foster a love and respect for wildlife in the hearts of those living in communities on the fringes of wildlife reserves, helping to prevent them from engaging in a future of poaching.</narrative>
  </description>
